cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Open-NSIM: 2D Prophetic Management Cycle (Niyyah – Syura – Itqan – Muhasabah × SAFT)"
message: "If you adopt, teach, or build upon the NSIM Prophetic Management Cycle in research, training, or organizational SOPs, please cite this specification."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Abelian
    given-names: Ridlo
    website: "https://ridlo.id"
abstract: >-
  Open-NSIM is an open, value-laden 2D Prophetic Management standard uniting
  the 4-stage NSIM operational cycle (Niyyah & Ru'yah, Syura & Tadbir, Itqan &
  I'anah, Muhasabah & Hisbah) with the 4 Prophetic character traits (SAFT:
  Shiddiq, Amanah, Fathanah, Tabligh), operationalized through 13 Hadith and
  Sirah protocols, a 1-Page Execution Canvas, GitHub governance templates, JSON
  Schema, and an AI Agent Skill.
